{
  "title": "document_ingestion_workflow",
  "description": "文档入库质检工作流：接收质检 Skill 判出的主路由，把文档分流到对应的解析流程（扫描型→OCR、文字型→直接抽文字、混合型→逐页判断、其余→人工复核）。",
  "canvas_type": "Agent",
  "avatar": "",
  "dsl": {
    "components": {
      "begin": {
        "obj": {
          "component_name": "Begin",
          "params": {
            "enablePrologue": false,
            "mode": "Webhook",
            "prologue": "",
            "inputs": {
              "route": {
                "name": "route",
                "type": "string",
                "optional": false
              },
              "path": {
                "name": "path",
                "type": "string",
                "optional": true
              },
              "tags": {
                "name": "tags",
                "type": "string",
                "optional": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "downstream": ["Switch:RouteByQuality"],
        "upstream": []
      },
      "Switch:RouteByQuality": {
        "obj": {
          "component_name": "Switch",
          "params": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "logical_operator": "and",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "cpn_id": "begin@route",
                    "operator": "=",
                    "value": "ocr"
                  }
                ],
                "to": ["Message:ToOCR"]
              },
              {
                "logical_operator": "and",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "cpn_id": "begin@route",
                    "operator": "=",
                    "value": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "to": ["Message:ToText"]
              },
              {
                "logical_operator": "and",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "cpn_id": "begin@route",
                    "operator": "=",
                    "value": "hybrid"
                  }
                ],
                "to": ["Message:ToHybrid"]
              }
            ],
            "end_cpn_ids": ["Message:ToReview"]
          }
        },
        "downstream": [
          "Message:ToOCR",
          "Message:ToText",
          "Message:ToHybrid",
          "Message:ToReview"
        ],
        "upstream": ["begin"]
      },
      "Message:ToOCR": {
        "obj": {
          "component_name": "Message",
          "params": {
            "content": [
              "【路由 → OCR 解析器】\n文件：{begin@path}\n标签：{begin@tags}\n\n该文档没有文字层，直接抽文字会得到空白，必须走 OCR（RAGFlow 的 DeepDOC 解析器自带 OCR）。"
            ]
          }
        },
        "downstream": [],
        "upstream": ["Switch:RouteByQuality"]
      },
      "Message:ToText": {
        "obj": {
          "component_name": "Message",
          "params": {
            "content": [
              "【路由 → 直接抽文字】\n文件：{begin@path}\n标签：{begin@tags}\n\n该文档自带文字层，走 plain_text 解析即可，不需要 OCR（省时间）。"
            ]
          }
        },
        "downstream": [],
        "upstream": ["Switch:RouteByQuality"]
      },
      "Message:ToHybrid": {
        "obj": {
          "component_name": "Message",
          "params": {
            "content": [
              "【路由 → 逐页判断】\n文件：{begin@path}\n标签：{begin@tags}\n\n该文档部分页有文字层、部分页要 OCR，需要按页决定解析方式。"
            ]
          }
        },
        "downstream": [],
        "upstream": ["Switch:RouteByQuality"]
      },
      "Message:ToReview": {
        "obj": {
          "component_name": "Message",
          "params": {
            "content": [
              "【路由 → 人工复核】\n文件：{begin@path}\n标签：{begin@tags}\n\n路由值不在已知集合内（可能为空或文档判为坏文件），不自动入库，转人工确认。"
            ]
          }
        },
        "downstream": [],
        "upstream": ["Switch:RouteByQuality"]
      }
    },
    "globals": {
      "sys.conversation_turns": 0,
      "sys.files": [],
      "sys.query": "",
      "sys.user_id": ""
    },
